+/// Stage F4-A: rewrites root-position selector-recovery chains into
+/// `Ast::Memo(slot)` and returns the per-slot subtrees alongside.
+///
+/// Returns `(expressions, shared)`; with `shared` empty the expressions are
+/// returned untouched (that is the `ORCHARD_F4A=0` baseline, and the fallback
+/// when no chain turns out to have more than one consumer).
